Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:24.47,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}喉嚨深處帶著熾熱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:29.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}那聲聲問詢 至今仍在敲擊我的後背
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:33.85,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}在我的腦海裡飛馳而過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:40.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}如果那樣可以的話 那樣也無妨
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.02,0:21:47.02,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}若並非如此 那就於此刻下定決心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:51.77,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}聽到的聲音毫無疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.77,0:21:54.06,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}是某一刻的我的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:58.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}不論是誰的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.35,0:22:01.39,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}也無所謂 我會將其傳達
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:08.18,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}傳達給賦予我的聲音以意義的那個人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:11.64,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}也能夠將某人的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:15.02,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}一起帶走 等待著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:20.35,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}跨越這聲音 這思念 跨越我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.35,0:22:23.60,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}跨越無聲的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:27.06,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}去見你 等待著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.06,0:22:31.89,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5\an1\fn@方正稚艺_GBK\frz-90\pos(15,15)}相信這聲音 這思念 相信我吧
